This directory holds the scripts that drive training on the remote server.
They are expected to exist on the machine that trains; their contents are not
tracked.

  remote-setup-server.sh      once: the key reaches the server, the branch
                              reaches GitHub, the project is cloned there
  remote-git-pull.sh          the server checks out omr and resets to origin/omr
  remote-start-training.sh    training runs there, detached, logging to
                              training-data/training.log
  remote-download-model.sh    the weights and the log come home, with their sha

Not tracked because the scripts name a server and an ssh key — they are
personal to the machine that runs them. dev-docs/training.html describes the
same workflow in full, so a fresh clone can rebuild them from the doc.
